01:54:24,384 --> 01:54:30,124
If not, yes, I have a question, I guess.

1234
01:54:30,664 --> 01:54:39,444
Your friend is asking, teacher, have you any, have you got any advice to read something in English?

1235
01:54:41,344 --> 01:54:42,364
Hi, [öğrenci].

